CONNECT sf-axle4-1.axle4 -> lk-axle8-1.axle8~ LOCKED
WHY Joins the finished rear axle unit to the chassis, with the yellow and red axles plugging into the drive shafts coming back from the motors.
STEP 210
CONNECT rx-bent-1.hole1~ -> fl-panel-1.hole11~ STIFF
CONNECT rz-bent-1.hole1~ -> fl-panel-2.hole11~ STIFF
WHY Pushes the rear axle fully in so its beams sit against the floor panels and the shafts engage.
